<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (We start with a presentation on AI and computer vision, learning how machines rely on visual patterns rather than true understanding. Next, we connect to mBlock 5 and program basic mBot2 movements calibrated to the Smart Camera. By applying the Sense-Think-Act loop, students code the robot to make real-time decisions based on camera inputs, such as stopping at a red sign or turning at a specific marker.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
